      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "呪い師の集団“シシアの秘印”という連中が\n日没砦を根城にしているようだ。\nこいつらは生贄の儀式で魔力が高まると信じてる。\n家畜が何頭も消えてる。誰か奴らを追い払えないか？",
        "official_en": "Sithya's Secret Seal, a group of spellcasters holed up\nin Sunset Fortress, think ritual sacrifice increases\ntheir magic powers. Now livestock has started going\nmissing! Someone needs to run them spellcasters off!",
        "real_en": "Sisia's Secret Seal, a group of spellcasters holed up\nin Sunset Fortress, think ritual sacrifice increases\ntheir magic powers. Now livestock has started going\nmissing! Someone needs to run them spellcasters off!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
