      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "奴らがいなくなったあとを調べたら\n夥しい数の獣の骨、骨、骨……！\nそんなことで魔力が高まるものか。\nまあいい。依頼は完了だ。助かったよ。",
        "official_en": "I heard you ran them off. Well done. I've also heard\ndisturbing things from the farmers. They found a\nhill-sized pile of animal bones. More than they could\ncount! They thank you for your help.",
